==Battleground==
*1 [[DONALD MORDEN (Enemy)|DONALD MORDEN]] spawns as the boss.
*10 [[MARS PEOPLE (Enemy)|MARS PEOPLE]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[MARS PEOPLE (Enemy)|MARS PEOPLE]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6~18 seconds<sup>180f~540f</sup>.
*3 [[MARCO (Enemy)|MARCOs]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[ALLEN O'NEIL (Enemy)|ALLEN O'NEIL]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[SV-001 (Enemy)|SV-001]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[SV-001 (Enemy)|SV-001]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[HI-DO (Enemy)|HI-DO]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[MARCO (Enemy)|MARCOs]] spawn, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[MARS PEOPLE (Enemy)|MARS PEOPLE]] spawn, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[HUGE HERMIT (Enemy)|HUGE HERMITs]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[SV-001 (Enemy)|SV-001s]] spawn, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.
**1 [[ALLEN O'NEIL (Enemy)|ALLEN O'NEIL]] spawns.
**3 [[MARCO (Enemy)|MARCOs]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[MARS PEOPLE (Enemy)|MARS PEOPLE]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[MARCO (Enemy)|MARCOs]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
To get a high score, high damage [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]] such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] are recommended.

